  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>dt</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is a continuous odd function. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cosx</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math> is equal to _____.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfenced><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfenced><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>dy</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>dy</mi></math> (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is odd)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math> is also odd.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cosx</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><mi>cosx</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cosxdx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cosxdx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cosxdx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sinx</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>xsinxdx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>xcosx</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sinx</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
